# Annotations for the fully-loaded FS2 DISK image (build/fs2-vice-mem.bin).
# Addresses are disk-build addresses (differ slightly from the tape crack).
# Format: ADDR name [comment]
2285 irq_main raster-split IRQ (rewrites D018/D016 mid-frame)
2700 nmi_main
25EB vic_init standard bitmap mode, VIC bank 1, sprites on
5F45 vic_mode_switch panel/3D display swap
B520 reset_entry hardware RESET vector target
